<section id="许可" class="level3">
<h3><a href="#许可" title="Link to section: § &#39;许可&#39;">许可</a></h3>
<p><span id="copyright"></span></p>
<p>本网站根据 <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E5%85%B1%E4%BA%AB" id="_w6LWheck" class="link-live" data-link-icon="wikipedia" data-link-icon-type="svg" data-url-iframe="https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E5%85%B1%E4%BA%AB#bodyContent">知识共享</a> <a href="https://creativecommons.org/public-domain/cc0/" id="_6BIgsmnJ" data-link-icon="creative-commons" data-link-icon-type="svg" title="‘CC-0: Creative Commons public domain license’, Commons 2002">公共领域 (CC-0)</a> 许可进行许可。</p>
<p>我相信公共领域许可减少了 <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fear,_uncertainty,_and_doubt" id="_ijtnaB6E" class="link-live" data-link-icon="wikipedia" data-link-icon-type="svg" data-url-iframe="https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fear,_uncertainty,_and_doubt#bodyContent">FUD</a> 和 <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%97%A0%E8%B0%93%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1" id="_i9sIkU5h" class="link-live" data-link-icon="wikipedia" data-link-icon-type="svg" data-url-iframe="https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%97%A0%E8%B0%93%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1#bodyContent">无谓损失</a><a href="#fn38" class="footnote-ref" id="fnref38" role="doc-noteref"><sup>38</sup></a>，鼓励复制 (<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/LOCKSS" id="_h47-Rr7l" class="link-live" data-link-icon="wikipedia" data-link-icon-type="svg" data-url-iframe="https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/LOCKSS#bodyContent">LOCKSS</a>)，回馈（无论多少）给 <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6" id="_HfAiWif4" class="link-live" data-link-icon="wikipedia" data-link-icon-type="svg" data-url-iframe="https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6#bodyContent">自由软件</a>/<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9" id="_BqZ9kHXS" class="link-live" data-link-icon="wikipedia" data-link-icon-type="svg" data-url-iframe="https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9#bodyContent">自由内容</a>，并且我不花一分钱<a href="#fn39" class="footnote-ref" id="fnref39" role="doc-noteref"><sup>39</sup></a>。</p>
